<title>USA: TABLE-Precision Optics Q4 June 30 loss.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Precision Optics Q4 June 30 loss.</headline>
<dateline>GARDNER, Mass. 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>FOURTH QUARTER AND YEAR ENDED JUNE 30, 1997</p>
<p>					   Fourth Quarter Ended June 30</p>
<p>							 1997	   1996</p>
<p> Revenues				    $1,229,423    $2,400,147</p>
<p> Net Income (Loss)			 ( 494,569)	 169,447</p>
<p>Weighted Average Common and Common</p>
<p>  Equivalent Shares Outstanding	 5,987,335     6,111,642</p>
<p> Earnings (Loss) Per Share		  ( 0.08)	    0.03</p>
<p>						     Year Ended June 30</p>
<p>							1997	    1996</p>
<p> Revenues				     7,372,310     8,055,271</p>
<p> Net Income (Loss)			 ( 442,633)	 405,710</p>
<p>Weighted Average Common and Common</p>
<p>  Equivalent Shares Outstanding	 5,982,210     6,116,569</p>
<p> Earnings (Loss) Per Share		  ( 0.07)	    0.07</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said Q4 net income and revenues fell because of lower sales of medical and night-vision products.</p>
<p>Full name is Precision Optics Corp Inc.</p>
